<title>USA: Santander Investment adds Brazil analysts.</title>
<headline>Santander Investment adds Brazil analysts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investments has hired two more analysts in Sao Paulo, Brazil, the brokerage said.</p>
<p>Santander Investment, an affiliate of Spain's Banco Santander SA, said in a statement it had hired Monica Carvalho to cover Brazil's steel sector and Daniela Muszkat Bretthauer to cover retail, household appliances and textiles.</p>
<p>Carvalho had worked for Merrill Lynch as an analyst in Sao Paulo. Bretthauer had been an analyst for Brazil's Unibanco.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
